  "text": {
    "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
    "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-c27b3ab3c8@example.invalid",
    "text": "<p>&nbsp;Stryker Corporation (NYSE:SYK) announced that its Board of Directors has declared a quarterly dividend of $0.425 per share payable on July 31, 2017 to shareholders of record at the close of business on June 30, 2017, representing an increase of 12% versus the prior year and unchanged from the previous quarter.&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://investors.stryker.com/press-releases/news-details/2017/Stryker-declares-a-0425-per-share-quarterly-dividend-20170503000000/default.aspx\">Read the full release here</a>.&nbsp;</p>\n",
